math.rdn
Copyright (c) 2023-2026 Ray Den
SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT

Purpose:
Math constants and helpers for Raden.

Loading behavior:
This module also loads the native math module through the shared-library suffix:
../nativelibs/math(.so|.dylib|.dll)

Exports:
- sqrt : native square root
- powf : native floating-point power
- pow  : general power helper
- M_E M_LOG2E M_LOG10E M_LN2 M_LN10
- M_PI M_PI_2 M_PI_4
- M_1_PI M_2_PI M_2_SQRTPI
- M_SQRT2 M_SQRT1_2

Stack contracts:
number sqrt call -> result
base exponent powf call -> result
base exponent pow call -> result

Examples:
"./libs/math.rdn" load
4 sqrt call print
"\n" print
2 8 pow call print
*]

"../nativelibs/math" __sharedlib_ext to_string swap pop append loadnative

2.7182818284590452354  M_E		    const
1.4426950408889634074  M_LOG2E	    const
0.43429448190325182765 M_LOG10E	    const
0.69314718055994530942 M_LN2		const
2.30258509299404568402 M_LN10		const
3.14159265358979323846 M_PI		    const
1.57079632679489661923 M_PI_2		const
0.78539816339744830962 M_PI_4		const
0.31830988618379067154 M_1_PI		const
0.63661977236758134308 M_2_PI		const
1.12837916709551257390 M_2_SQRTPI	const
1.41421356237309504880 M_SQRT2	    const
0.70710678118654752440 M_SQRT1_2	const

sqrt defun
    sqrtOf call
end

powf defun
    powerOf call
end

pow defun
    powerOf call
end
